      <shape width="160" height="32" topLeftX="705.6155118110237" topLeftY="54.487716535433066" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" letterSpacing="1.1"><em><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false" letterSpacing="1.1">哈理工A.I.R.创新实验室</span></em></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="66.94629921259842" height="50.8" topLeftX="33.25511811023622" topLeftY="15.769133858267715" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="36" fontFamily="锐字真言体免费商用" strikethrough="false" underline="false">03</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="560" height="36.25" topLeftX="110.86724409448817" topLeftY="33.10251968503937" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">频率和占空比，谁管谁？</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="124" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">① 周期由 ARR 定</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">频率 = 计数时钟 ÷ (ARR+1)。PSC 配 71 得到 1MHz，ARR 填 999 就是一个周期 1 毫秒，即 1kHz。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="194" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">② 高电平由 CCR 定</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">比较值 CCR 是「数到几翻转」，也就是高电平持续多久。这就是我们运行时唯一要改的数。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="264" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">③ 占空比 = CCR ÷ (ARR+1)</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">1MHz 下 CCR 写 500，就是高 500 微秒、占空比 50%；写 100 就是 10%，灯很暗。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="378" height="230" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="112" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(240, 240, 240, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <border color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" width="1" lineJoin="miter" miterLimit="10"/>
      </shape>
      <shape width="354" height="212" topLeftX="522" topLeftY="120" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Consolas" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="no-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 72MHz → 1MHz，1 个数 = 1us</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">htim1.Init.Prescaler = 72 - 1;</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">htim1.Init.Period = 1000 - 1;</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 周期 1000us → 1kHz</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">__HAL_TIM_SET_COMPARE(&amp;htim1, TIM_CHANNEL_2, 500);</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 高 500us → 占空比 50%</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="817.58" height="34" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="14" paddingRight="14" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">周期看 ARR、宽度看 CCR、占空比是两者的比——三个数就能描述一路 PWM。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note>
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">这一页把上一页的三个概念落到寄存器上。PSC 和 ARR 决定周期，也就是频率；CCR 决定高电平的长度，也就是占空比。运行时我们只改 CCR，用宏 __HAL_TIM_SET_COMPARE 就能改。为什么先分频到 1 兆？因为这样每个计数就是 1 微秒，算脉宽特别直观：要 500 微秒就写 500，要 1.5 毫秒就写 1500。舵机那一节会用到这个技巧。还有一个必须注意的：PWM 必须在 CubeMX 里把通道配成 PWM Generation，并调用 HAL_TIM_PWM_Start，跟前面定时器中断一样，少一句就是没波形。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
